{"src":"en","tgt":"id","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"id","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7958.7249170000005,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8461.699118999999,"text":"Namun, zona Shenzhen bekerja agak seperti satu negara dalam hal ini."},{"kind":"audio","t":8556.017259999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8560.851080999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8566.311181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8568.424966999999,"samples":16774,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":15115.915522,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":15786.08696,"text":"Terletak di puncak salah satu gunung di utara Mekkah, gua tersebut berada sangat"},{"kind":"audio","t":15880.718096,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15885.877051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15890.954438,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15894.138156,"samples":21789,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"input","t":17742.776785,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18057.42473,"text":"terisolasi dari seluruh dunia."},{"kind":"audio","t":18104.801602,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18105.609568,"samples":19894,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"input","t":26295.4673,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27041.680929,"text":"Kini orang-orang menulis pesan di layar komputer tanpa harus mendekati rautan pensil."},{"kind":"audio","t":27155.305484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27160.151314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27165.448887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27170.563153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27170.906957,"samples":2396,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":37543.547363,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":39039.485284,"text":"Wisatawan yang menuju negara-negara dengan pajak tinggi terkadang dapat menghemat cukup banyak uang, terutama untuk produk-produk seperti minuman beralkohol dan tembakau."},{"kind":"audio","t":39223.06476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39228.059958,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39233.343721,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39238.376648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39243.310707,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39248.423353,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39253.205565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39255.458518,"samples":25300,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"input","t":45787.733883,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46331.26956,"text":"Tumbuhan membuat makanannya sendiri dari matahari melalui fotosintesis. Mereka juga memberikan naungan."},{"kind":"audio","t":46442.523083,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46447.385333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46452.721126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46454.550016,"samples":15102,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"audio","t":46460.285551,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46462.503045,"samples":16551,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":58075.856421,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59135.550752999996,"text":"Rumah sakit telah mengikuti protokol pengendalian infeksi, termasuk memisahkan pasien dari orang lain untuk mencegah kemungkinan penularan kepada orang lain."},{"kind":"audio","t":59315.732465,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":59320.600995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59325.834119,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59331.194801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59336.288458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59341.567921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59345.807611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59346.275563999996,"samples":7188,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":68180.546189,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69313.15888900001,"text":"Pekerjaan yang dilakukan sebagian besar bersifat teoretis, tetapi program tersebut ditulis untuk mensimulasikan pengamatan yang dilakukan terhadap galaksi Sagittarius."},{"kind":"audio","t":69497.230821,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69502.107848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69507.305189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69512.630718,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69517.895139,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69523.99286500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69528.31797100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69531.250981,"samples":30594,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"input","t":78310.524953,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79392.88992,"text":"Bahasa resmi Barcelona adalah Catalan dan Spanyol. Sekitar setengahnya lebih suka berbicara bahasa Catalan, sebagian besar memahaminya, dan hampir semua orang menguasai bahasa Spanyol."},{"kind":"audio","t":79480.052704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79484.604976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79488.08343700001,"samples":21956,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":79566.18480500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79570.98205400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79576.145136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79581.335437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79586.598767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79591.671491,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79594.67114,"samples":22959,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"input","t":83795.889313,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":84575.80723600001,"text":"Di beberapa daerah, merebus air selama satu menit sudah cukup dan di daerah lain diperlukan beberapa menit."},{"kind":"audio","t":84701.826128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84706.38478000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84711.74803900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84716.92589000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84721.92211500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84722.536775,"samples":7801,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":90025.81318900001,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":90947.05416300001,"text":"Tanaman terlihat paling indah saat berada di lingkungan alami, jadi tahanlah godaan untuk memetik meski hanya satu batang."},{"kind":"audio","t":91089.78744900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91094.597727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91099.88283700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91104.99374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91110.44499700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91115.06854800001,"samples":29535,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"input","t":97338.36508700001,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98434.734435,"text":"Selama tahun 1920-an, sikap yang berkembang dari sebagian besar warga negara dan bangsa adalah pasifisme dan isolasi."},{"kind":"audio","t":98595.014303,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98599.82776100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98605.230699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":98610.43329,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98615.66434100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98620.99365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98625.34944600001,"samples":31318,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"input","t":103529.22524900001,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104312.446356,"text":"Masa Serif adalah predator puncak pada masanya, sehingga ia tidak takut pada apa pun kecuali Mosul lainnya"},{"kind":"audio","t":104438.611405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104443.32244500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104448.449487,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104453.58501000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104458.44524700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104459.74704500001,"samples":9752,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":113139.16109000001,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114200.823289,"text":"Sejak pendirian Asuncion pada tahun 1537, Paraguay telah berhasil mempertahankan banyak karakter dan identitas pribuminya."},{"kind":"audio","t":114374.05019600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114378.898413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114384.32691100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114389.377145,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114394.58897600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114399.88326500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":114404.99882800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114406.318176,"samples":16941,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":119868.912024,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120650.34655100001,"text":"Penyakit ini dibawa oleh babi, yang kemudian berpindah ke manusia melalui nyamuk."},{"kind":"audio","t":120748.67281500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120753.622451,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120758.60404600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120762.983921,"samples":28198,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"input","t":129358.550635,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130423.63289600001,"text":"Sebagian besar teleskop riset modern adalah fasilitas raksasa di daerah terpencil dengan kondisi atmosfer yang menguntungkan."},{"kind":"audio","t":130560.209888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130561.26009000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130562.773704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130564.315758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130565.87449100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130567.32787700002,"samples":30650,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"input","t":135223.483034,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":135963.388399,"text":"Orang mungkin tidak menyangka bahwa kesabaran dan pengertian juga diperlukan bagi para pelancong"},{"kind":"audio","t":136069.284734,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136074.21063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136079.329772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136084.485635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136084.984576,"samples":7411,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":140540.439005,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141030.409941,"text":"Jadi kemungkinan besar notasi tersebut ditambahkan hanya sebagai label."},{"kind":"audio","t":141121.256123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141126.283947,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141131.36799,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141133.11992,"samples":14266,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":147768.00923199998,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148286.140219,"text":"Namun ada banyak hal tentang burung yang masih terlihat seperti dinosaurus."},{"kind":"audio","t":148380.79806499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148385.7418,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":148391.08880899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148393.098325,"samples":15938,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"input","t":154956.21141999998,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":155897.217757,"text":"Hampir semuanya adalah pantai berpasir dengan tempat berenang yang aman dan sebagian besar memiliki peneduh yang disediakan oleh"},{"kind":"audio","t":156037.320969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156042.11401699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156047.314338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156052.676187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156057.890938,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156062.075537,"samples":27306,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"input","t":157898.52141699998,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158144.020291,"text":"pohon Pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":158177.337963,"samples":28142,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"input","t":164344.594448,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165438.89301099998,"text":"Duvall, yang sudah menikah dan memiliki dua anak dewasa, tidak meninggalkan kesan mendalam bagi Miller, orang yang diceritakan kisah tersebut."},{"kind":"audio","t":165592.885006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165597.702254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165602.757357,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165608.073717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165613.12802099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165618.399801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165619.62636,"samples":11814,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"close","t":175703.756665,"code":1005}]}